  And.intro @FRC.Dark.cohsum_three (@FRC.Dark.neff_equal)
/-- p32042 — 32:P5. Coherence-state cluster gas: the X-ray gas gravitates only when bulk-coherent, contributing in a relaxed cluster ($C_{ij}\to1$) and dropping out of a merger ($C_{ij}\to0$), the lensing displacement growing with the shock Mach number; the quantitative core residual of the same law is the conjecture Y1. Falsifier: a merger lensing peak tracking the shocked gas, or no relaxed-versus-merging difference. -/
